 "description": "EgoSecure’s Full Disk Encryption (FDE) software-only product provides sector-by-sector Full Disk Encryption services to the General Purpose Computer (GPC) with hardening Pre-Boot Authentication (PBA) capabilities. The software is able to prevent all unauthorized access to user data including the operating system with varying degrees of security depending on customer preference. The EgoSecure Full Disk Encryption (FDE) cryptographic module is the core underlying component providing cryptographic functionalities for the software in all aspects.",
